{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"1c420e9caea006446914efd1f5d43d47c528975ba09a5d4964a6fe7d3aa40c6c"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:c1f47faa18a192528ae68e47f370958c321e8cae233777068807f6bd26f7b53a","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"A few different natural settings outdoors","evidence":"[D6:16 | 8:18 pm on 6 July, 2023] Melanie: Glad you have support, Caroline! Unconditional love is so important. Here's a pic of my family camping at the beach. We love it, it brings us closer!\n[D4:6 | 10:37 am on 27 June, 2023] Melanie: That sounds great, Caroline! It's awesome having stuff around that make us think of good connections and times. Actually, I just took my fam camping in the mountains last week - it was a really nice time together!\n[D8:32 | 1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023] Melanie: Yeah, Caroline, my family's been great - their love and support really helped me through tough times. It's awesome! We even went on another camping trip in the forest.","itemId":"urn:uuid:74516fb7-cadf-5307-b6f2-c58443c75b85","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:85b7e5f7678bb6d546fba0df9072baf15d20eb19d109b4242aecbbf521e5610d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where has Melanie camped?","referenceAnswer":"beach, mountains, forest","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"85b7e5f7678bb6d546fba0df9072baf15d20eb19d109b4242aecbbf521e5610d"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}